.visible=\"'!found;}if(i>16&&!bridgeOpen){bridgeOpen=true;createBridge(true);}if(i<2&&bridgeOpen){bridgeOpen=false;createBridge(false);}\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\nnpm run build'","aggregated_output":"npm notice run pitfall-ish---the-understory-pitfall-ii-lost-caverns-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-221209@1.0.0 build\nnpm notice run node build.mjs\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"The first route test caught a balloon bug: its gentle sway accumulated sideways, carrying it out of the shaft. That’s fixed. The official two-player AI Hub check also passed; I’m checking dedicated hosting, the complete rescue route, and headless rendering next.\n"}}
