{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"agent_message","text":"The full physics playthrough now completes all three rescues and the return to camp. Rendering checks found a separate environment issue: this machine loses its WebGPU device even on a minimal clear-frame test. I’m adding recovery through Three.js’s WebGL2 backend so that failure won’t leave the game invisible; WebGPU remains the primary renderer.\n"}}
